```console
$ scherzo-cloud service-principal create --help
Create a service principal and initial API key

Usage: scherzo-cloud service-principal create [OPTIONS] --display-name <NAME> --api-key-file <PATH|->

Options:
      --display-name <NAME>    Set the service display name
      --api-key-file <PATH|->  Create the protected API-key file, or write only the API key to standard output
      --json                   Print the service-principal result as JSON
      --allow-insecure-http    Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                   Print help

```
